#Linux
Okuphumayo bhala: (Umyalo ls -la), umugqa-omusha.
Okuphumayo bhala: (Indlela /home gabor Desktop), umugqa-omusha.
Okuphumayo bhala: (Indlela /root: ['my\\ documents'], business presentations), umugqa-omusha.
Okuphumayo bhala: ((Umyalo ls: ['my\\ documents']) > ['list.txt']), umugqa-omusha.
Okuphumayo bhala: ((Umyalo do: ['this'], futhi: ['that'])), umugqa-omusha.
Okuphumayo bhala: ((Indlela go: ['here'], futhi: ['there'])), umugqa-omusha.